Licensing index
===============

Application code, examples, C interface headers, Python bindings, verification
utilities and project documentation are Apache-2.0 where designated.
See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

APLUX proprietary contributions in the SDK library are covered by the Pandora
agreement, only to the extent APLUX owns or is authorized to license those rights.
The agreement does not replace upstream or third-party permissions. External
model packages and vendor runtimes retain their own terms. See LICENSING.md
and NOTICE for component scope and accompanying license texts.
